#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/diary.md:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Agent tools (ToolSet `diary`)"
msgstr "Agent 工具（ToolSet `diary`）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/diary.md:46
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Load via `toolset_load` with `diary`. Agent tools locate entries by "
#| "**`date` (YYYY-MM-DD)**; **default today** (CST noon `…T12:00:00+08:00`); "
#| "**no `diary_create`** — use `diary_append` (creates empty shell for the "
#| "day if missing, then appends)."
msgid ""
"Load via `toolset_load` with `diary`. Tools locate entries by **`date` (YYYY-"
"MM-DD)**；**default today** (CST noon `…T12:00:00+08:00`)；**no "
"`diary_create`** — use `diary_append` (creates empty shell for the day if "
"missing, then adds a **new text block**). All tools accept optional "
"**`world_id`**."
msgstr ""
"通过 `toolset_load` 加载 `diary`。Agent 工具按 **`date`（YYYY-MM-DD）** 定位"
"条目；**默认当天**（CST 正午 `…T12:00:00+08:00`）；**无 `diary_create`** — 使"
"用 `diary_append`（若缺失则为该日创建空壳，再追加）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/diary.md:55
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Tool           | Description                                                                                     |\n"
#| "| -------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| `diary_append` | Append body for date (`\\n\\n` separator); create shell if missing; `tags` only on shell creation |\n"
#| "| `diary_update` | Replace full entry or fields by date (not append)                                               |\n"
#| "| `diary_get`    | Read entry for date; error if not found                                                         |\n"
#| "| `diary_delete` | Delete entry for date; returns `{ ok, action, date }`                                           |\n"
#| "| `diary_list`   | List / date filter (unchanged)                                                                  |\n"
#| "| `diary_search` | Hybrid search (unchanged)                                                                       |\n"
msgid ""
"| Tool           | Description                                                                     |\n"
"| -------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `diary_append` | New text block for date; create shell if missing; `tags` only on shell creation |\n"
"| `diary_update` | Update entry **metadata** (title/summary/tags) by date — not body text          |\n"
"| `diary_get`    | Read entry + `blocks` for date; error if not found                              |\n"
"| `diary_delete` | Delete entry for date (cascades child blocks); returns `{ ok, action, date }`   |\n"
"| `diary_list`   | List / date filter (+ blocks)                                                   |\n"
"| `diary_search` | Hybrid search over **text blocks**, returns matching diary entries              |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 工具           | 说明                                                                 |\n"
"| -------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `diary_append` | 按日期追加正文（`\\n\\n` 分隔）；缺失则创建壳；`tags` 仅在创建壳时生效 |\n"
"| `diary_update` | 按日期替换整篇或字段（非追加）                                       |\n"
"| `diary_get`    | 读取指定日期条目；不存在则报错                                       |\n"
"| `diary_delete` | 删除指定日期条目；返回 `{ ok, action, date }`                        |\n"
"| `diary_list`   | 列表 / 日期筛选（不变）                                              |\n"
"| `diary_search` | 混合搜索（不变）                                                     |\n"

#. type: Plain text
